flowchart LR
  email[Received mail] --> dedup{Processed ID?}
  dedup -- Yes --> skip[Skip extraction]
  dedup -- No --> context[Active calendar and tasks]
  context --> extract[Structured extraction]
  extract --> valid{All fields valid?}
  valid -- No --> failed[Trace failure; retain retry]
  failed --> retry[Correct / retry]
  retry --> extract
  valid -- Yes --> tools[Calendar and task tools]
  tools --> changes[Create / cancel / linked reschedule]
  changes --> conflict[Mark conflicts and suggest slots]
  conflict --> draft[Trace and reply draft]
  draft --> review[Human approval before send]
